ed loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2476650/extras/69848562b0b411330b164a55aef8f86f.poster.avif?t=1771079474\" width=1170 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2476650/extras/69848562b0b411330b164a55aef8f86f.webm?t=1771079474\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2476650/extras/69848562b0b411330b164a55aef8f86f.mp4?t=1771079474\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some truck takes your parking place? No problem, you can forklift them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place Kei Cars on the right parking spots,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They can have alarms, </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And might be Wired, </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be smart about parking gates,  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use illegal moves when no one sees,\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But sometimes you can Help others.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maybe they will show you how to cook Ramen?\u00a0 Of course using a forklift!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2476650/extras/c2d5acb20b6d7e7875e9367ee88e8ada.poster.avif?t=1771079474\" width=1170 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2476650/extras/c2d5acb20b6d7e7875e9367ee88e8ada.webm?t=1771079474\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2476650/extras/c2d5acb20b6d7e7875e9367ee88e8ada.mp4?t=1771079474\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Featuring:</h2><